<title>USA: Advanced Radio in $135 million debt offer.</title>
<headline>Advanced Radio in $135 million debt offer.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Wash. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Radio Telecom Corp said it is offering 135,000 units of $135 million aggregate principal amount of senior notes due 2007 and 2,025,000 warrants to buy an aggregate 2,731,725 shares of ART Common Stock.</p>
<p>The underwriters for the offering are Merrill Lynch &amp; Co and CIBC Wood Gundy Securities Corp, the company said.</p>
<p>The senior notes will bear interest at a rate of 14 percent, payable semiannually, the company said.</p>
</text>
